type: Drill
name: "Titan Drill"
description: "A heavy industrial excavation platform capable of fracturing dense geological formations. Required to extract hard volatile deposits (Boreonite, Frost-Magnetite, Boreal Clathrate). Requires electrical power and can be boosted with Chilled Water."
size: 5
tier: 2
drillTime: 150
itemCapacity: 40
